/*
 * Roligt Plant Ops — complete application definition (.ds)
 * Generated from docs/zoho-build-pack.md §1–3; syntax verified against a live
 * Creator export (Field Probe, 21-Sep-2026). Import at creator.zoho.in/importds.
 * Keep this file in version control — it is the app's backup.
